100	**CSS Anchor Positioning** (Chrome 125+) — Position tooltips relative to elements:
101	```css
102	.node { anchor-name: --node-tooltip; }
103	.tooltip {
104	  position: fixed; position-anchor: --node-tooltip;
105	  position-area: block-start; margin-bottom: 8px;
106	}
107	```
108	Use for: architecture diagrams, org charts, any element needing positioned annotations.
