284	**Chart configuration enhancements:**
285	- Custom padding: `layout: { padding: { top: 30, right: 30, bottom: 30, left: 30 } }`
286	- Rounded corners on bars: `borderRadius: 4`
287	- Professional grid opacity: Light mode `rgba(0,0,0,0.04)`, Dark mode `rgba(255,255,255,0.02)`
288	- Thoughtful color palettes matching theme accent
