291	
292	### Spacing
293	- **8px grid** — all spacing in multiples: 4, 8, 12, 16, 24, 32, 48, 64, 96px
294	- **Generous padding** — `p-6` to `p-8` on cards, `px-8` on containers
295	- **Container:** `max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8`
